		{
			"id": "eo1BdwLuwEPDPOND4",
			"description": "Plasma Pistol",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Widely carried by Inquisitors, veteran officers and Astartes as a compact answer to armour a bolt pistol cannot beat; Black Library and Codex background repeatedly show plasma pistols overheating and injuring or killing careless users, a trait long associated with older, unstable patterns especially.\n\nDesign: Scaled down two dice from the plasma gun anchor (6dx2(3) burn ex) to 4dx2(3) burn ex for the standard, safe firing mode; the ×3 supercharged mode trades a Malf 14 risk for another 50% of damage, following the same standard/overcharge relationship used across this file. See the Plasma Gun entry for the full penetration check against armour; a pistol-class charge still clears flak and carapace comfortably and can trouble carapace-plus targets when supercharged.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Imperium",
				"Adeptus Astartes",
				"Inquisition"
			],
			"tech_level": "11",
