		{
			"id": "eKHgSjbulJ6LgaJVK",
			"description": "Plasma Cannon",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A tripod- or vehicle-mounted heavy weapon fielded by Astra Militarum heavy weapon teams and Devastator squads, background consistently treats it as a slow-firing but devastating answer to Astartes-scale infantry and light vehicles at range, at the price of a low rate of fire while the reactor cycles.\n\nDesign: Two dice over the plasma gun anchor (8d vs 6d), matching the standard progression used for the bolt and melta families in this project. Low RoF 1 and ST 15 (tripod or a very strong user) capture the \"slow-firing but devastating\" character the fiction gives it; Malf 15 rather than 14 for the standard/overcharge pair reflects a crew-served weapon's better cooling and shielding, at correspondingly higher stakes for the crew when it does fail.",
