			"description": "Plasma Incinerator, Primaris Pattern",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Standard-issue Primaris plasma weapon (Hellblaster squads and others), Codex background describes it as an improved, more reliable containment design over the legacy plasma gun rather than a fundamentally different weapon.\n\nDesign: One pip over the plasma gun anchor (6d+1 vs 6d) for the \"improved\" cartridge, on a lighter, easier-handling ST 11 frame with better range (200/600) for the improved optics; the higher Malf 15 on its supercharged mode reflects the claimed better containment without pretending overheating risk is eliminated.",
